      "title": "The Hole by Hiroko Oyamada | Goodreads",
      "snippet": "The hole functions on a metaphorical level for multiple purposes, is it simply an Alice's Adventures in Wonderland portal, a grave, an image of a slot in society we must all fit within, or all of them at once. During her unemployed days in the summer heat, she mostly encounters others who are deemed unproductive members of society.",
