      "title": "The Hole (novel) - Wikipedia",
      "snippet": "The Hole (Japanese: 穴, Hepburn: Ana) is a novel by Hiroko Oyamada. Originally published in 2014, it is Oyamada's second novel to be translated into English, after The Factory. [1]",
