      "title": "The Hole (book) — Grokipedia",
      "snippet": "On Goodreads, The Hole holds an average rating of approximately 3.6 out of 5 stars, based on thousands of ratings across editions. Readers often praise its eerie atmosphere, vivid sensory details (such as summer heat and cicada noise), dreamlike quality, and subtle feminist critique of societal roles and isolation for women.",
